{"dog":{"age_group":"senior","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\n\nCosmos loves staring contests, and will always win! She is clean and well-behaved, give her some time and space, and she will definitely grow on you!\n\nCosmos may not be the first cat to run up and demand attention, but give her a little time and she'll start letting you into her world. Once she warms up, she'll greet you with the cutest little morning chirps and come over when she's ready for pets and her favorite butt pats. Cosmos spends a lot of her day happily relaxing and catching some Zzzs, and if you listen closely, you might even hear her softly snoring during one of her naps. Cosmos is the kind of cat who makes you earn her trust a little, which makes it that much sweeter when she chooses you as her person (or people!) She would love a calm home where she can settle in at her own pace and spend her golden years being loved.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=5&searchType=4&animalid=197090","id":"2b606bc89511cb0d9655b3d8c954d1f3","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/f3f5094e41c44834910f90843640405d-1790878999-1790879005-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/0b0ae61315e9498cb89309d664043541-1790878998-1790878998-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d20c4b89aecf4744a0c7c355a7c469a2-1790878997-1790878997-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/79725c8bbcb24dc687deeed6f9ce83db-1790878995-1790878995-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/efb38a94b8284b7b822e8dd169c2b57d-1790878995-1790878995-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/68fdb1557d2a40229912fadd45bde02a-177644